  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to enhancing the capacity of youth and women for employment in aquaculture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To establish a solid base for the provision of and access to good quality fingerlings and feed, technical and technological know-how, and managerial and other skills to farmers and officers in order to turn aquaculture into an economically viable, financially-self sustained and employment-generating sustainable enterprise, a pre-requisite for the sector to develop in a sustainable manner and make a difference in people&apos;s lives.</narrative>
  </description>
